      "text": "A director's casting decision in the digital public sphere has acted as a catalyst for a deeper debate on cultural ownership, transforming a mythic epic into a flashpoint for societal debate. This transformation leveraged the film production activity, igniting a cultural conflict that exposed a hidden power struggle over who may claim classical stories in mass-market film.",
